# Node: atomic.ByDefinition.BuiltinProp.Injective
# Run: litex -f examples/proof_nodes/atomic/by_definition/builtin_injective.lit
#
# Obligation: forall x1, x2 {1}: id1(x1) = id1(x2) => x1 = x2
# Singleton identity closes ambiently (no trust).

have fn id1(x {1}) {1} = x
by def $injective({1}, {1}, id1)
